cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article and the reproducibility artifacts."
type: software
title: "FORGE: On-Demand Dataset Curation and Model-Assisted Annotation for Driving Perception"
abstract: "Research code and reproducibility resources associated with the FORGE paper: on-demand dataset curation (Pillar 1), detector-assisted annotation with YOLO11x (Pillar 2) and VLM-assisted proposal assessment with Qwen3-VL (Pillar 3). The CarCara platform and the original images are not distributed; frozen, sanitized artifacts are archived on Zenodo."
version: 1.0.0
