    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23104407
    description: "Reproducibility artifacts (Zenodo). The article has no DOI of its own yet."
keywords:
  - driving perception
  - dataset curation
  - model-assisted annotation
  - YOLO11
  - vision-language model
  - reproducibility
